      * RPG III renamed fields of an externally described file (RV-30)
     H
     FCUSTMAS IF  E           K        DISK
      * Renames; a field without an external name needs no statement
     ICUSTREC
     I              CUSTNAME                        CNAME
     I              CUSTBAL                         CBAL
     I                                              CREDIT
      * Not converted: control level, name already used, bad external name
     I              CUSTNUM                         CUSTNOL1
     I              CUSTCITY                        CNAME
     I              BAD-NAME                        CBAD
     C                     MOVEL'A'       KEY     6
      * The renamed fields are set after a record was read
     C           KEY       CHAINCUSTMAS              50
     C                     READ CUSTMAS                  91
     C                     MOVE CNAME     SAVNAM 10
